  "id": "olive-oil-dip-for-italian-bread",
  "name": "Olive Oil Dip for Italian Bread",
  "subtitle": "A quick garlic, balsamic, and herb dipping sauce",
  "description": "Stir together olive oil, garlic, balsamic vinegar, Parmesan, oregano, and pepper for a simple dip served with bread.",
