      "text": "Mince the garlic and combine it with the balsamic vinegar."
    },
    {
      "step": 3,
      "text": "Stir the garlic mixture, Parmesan, crushed oregano, and black pepper into the oil."
    },
    {
      "step": 4,
      "text": "Serve immediately with Italian bread."
    }
